{"3549960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pink Chocolate", "steam_appid": 3549960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "[h1]Welcome to the Foundation of Pink Chocolate[/h1]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This early playable build is a focused, walkable prototype designed to showcase the core aesthetic, environmental layout, and spatial design of the project. Step into a highly detailed cafe and explore its surrounding small farm village as we establish the visual and technical groundwork for the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interactive Testing Feature: The Screenshot Hunt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To assist with community feedback and visual validation, this prototype includes a dedicated Screenshot Hunt and Viewport Alignment Tool. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Testers are tasked with tracking down the exact coordinates of our official store screenshots. Utilizing an on-screen event tracker, you will use a precise, fluid rotation alignment meter—functioning similarly to a guitar tuner app—to snap the camera into our exact production viewpoints. Successfully matching these angles helps us confirm rendering alignment, performance telemetry, and rigging fidelity across different hardware configurations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* The Cafe &amp; Village Grounds: Walk through the fully modeled interior and exterior spaces of the central cafe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Visual &amp; Atmospheric Showcase: Experience the real-time lighting, stylized shaders, and character scaling in their native environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Telemetry Alignment Tracker: Engage with the built-in viewpoint tuner to locate and validate key composition zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Roadmap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This environment serves as our architectural sandbox. While this version focuses purely on navigation, atmosphere, and visual alignment, the data gathered here will directly inform our upcoming systems, including expanded village exploration, character progression, and interactive mechanics.</p>", "about_the_game": "[h1]Welcome to the Foundation of Pink Chocolate[/h1]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This early playable build is a focused, walkable prototype designed to showcase the core aesthetic, environmental layout, and spatial design of the project. Step into a highly detailed cafe and explore its surrounding small farm village as we establish the visual and technical groundwork for the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interactive Testing Feature: The Screenshot Hunt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To assist with community feedback and visual validation, this prototype includes a dedicated Screenshot Hunt and Viewport Alignment Tool. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Testers are tasked with tracking down the exact coordinates of our official store screenshots. Utilizing an on-screen event tracker, you will use a precise, fluid rotation alignment meter—functioning similarly to a guitar tuner app—to snap the camera into our exact production viewpoints. Successfully matching these angles helps us confirm rendering alignment, performance telemetry, and rigging fidelity across different hardware configurations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* The Cafe &amp; Village Grounds: Walk through the fully modeled interior and exterior spaces of the central cafe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Visual &amp; Atmospheric Showcase: Experience the real-time lighting, stylized shaders, and character scaling in their native environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Telemetry Alignment Tracker: Engage with the built-in viewpoint tuner to locate and validate key composition zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Roadmap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This environment serves as our architectural sandbox. While this version focuses purely on navigation, atmosphere, and visual alignment, the data gathered here will directly inform our upcoming systems, including expanded village exploration, character progression, and interactive mechanics.</p>", "short_description": "In this Parable Universe, believers travel throughout the worlds to deliver and gather goods. Characters learn of miraculous anomalies. They prayerfully seek narrow paths to find answers to mysteries. Beware and battle the enemies who roam about to rob, kill, steal and destroy.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549960/785cf9954568223ca5a0a77afcaad71e69fedfa7/header.jpg?t=1786574671", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549960/251d4488f664d27aa11ff82d3d3c617db626e1a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786574671", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549960/251d4488f664d27aa11ff82d3d3c617db626e1a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786574671", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1070 / AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD (Solid State Drive) is highly recommended to ensure smooth asset streaming</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-12700 / AMD Ryzen 7 5700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060 / AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD (Solid State Drive) mandatory for smooth data streaming</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "Pink Chocolate © 2026 Daniel Chay. All rights reserved. Portions of this software utilize the Isomech platform, licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License (LGPL) © 2005-2026.", "developers": ["Daniel Chay"], "publishers": ["StarFluke"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 18, "description": "Partial Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549960/16b489ffc91f03814486ac4fb0064b4268d1df4a/ss_16b489ffc91f03814486ac4fb0064b4268d1df4a.600x338.jpg?t=1786574671", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549960/16b489ffc91f03814486ac4fb0064b4268d1df4a/ss_16b489ffc91f03814486a